{"id":"e805bd83d9457983","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-minimal-not-re.md","title":"极小度不是 c.e. 度","display":"thm-minimal-not-re — 极小度不是 c.e. 度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-minimal-not-re","aliases":["20-thm-minimal-not-re"],"display":"thm-minimal-not-re — 极小度不是 c.e. 度","chapter":"7","section":"7.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Corollary 7.5.5","source_pdf_pages":[193],"source_printed_pages":[159],"depends_on":["[[20-df-minimal]]","[[20-thm-ambos-split]]","[[20-df-redeg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-minimal-not-re"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-minimal-not-re</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-minimal-not-re — 极小度不是 c.e. 度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 7.5.5"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>159</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" href=\"?note=b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" title=\"20-df-minimal\">20-df-minimal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1013cc25d82f1ed8\" href=\"?note=1013cc25d82f1ed8\" title=\"20-thm-ambos-split\">20-thm-ambos-split</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Minimal}(\\mathbf a)\">\\(\\operatorname{Minimal}(\\mathbf a)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" href=\"?note=b8c49b6cb74c57b6\" title=\"20-df-minimal\">20-df-minimal</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1013cc25d82f1ed8\" href=\"?note=1013cc25d82f1ed8\" title=\"20-thm-ambos-split\">20-thm-ambos-split</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 是 c.e. 度族，见上游 redeg；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{deg}\">\\(\\mathrm{deg}\\)</span> 只区分集合族和度族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}not\\text{-}re}\\vdash\n\\mathbf a\\notin\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}not\\text{-}re}\\vdash\n\\mathbf a\\notin\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若为非零 c.e. 度，Sacks 分裂给出非零严格下度，违背极小性。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 7.5.5；印刷页 159；PDF 第 193 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-minimal","status":"resolved","id":"b8c49b6cb74c57b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-minimal]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-ambos-split","status":"resolved","id":"1013cc25d82f1ed8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-ambos-split]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-minimal","status":"resolved","id":"b8c49b6cb74c57b6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-thm-ambos-split]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-ambos-split","status":"resolved","id":"1013cc25d82f1ed8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-thm-ambos-split]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Minimal}(\\mathbf a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{deg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}not\\text{-}re}\\vdash\n\\mathbf a\\notin\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}.","display":true}],"bytes":1118,"backlinks":[{"id":"7820e9a540965dd4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-minimal]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-thm-minimal-not-re]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-350","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-minimal-not-re]] — 章 7；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-350","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-minimal-not-re]]"}],"outgoing":["b8c49b6cb74c57b6","1013cc25d82f1ed8","f389bdba28de0478"]}